# NFS exports for the mini cluster. One export: the volume-backed /exports as
# the NFSv4 pseudo-root (fsid=0). Every node mounts nfs:/ at /shared, so
# /shared/home is /exports/home on the server. no_root_squash so root on a node
# (slurmd) can manage files; sync for correctness over speed on this testbed.
/exports *(rw,sync,no_subtree_check,no_root_squash,fsid=0,crossmnt)
